  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "Summary\nYoroi DRep votes YES on the treasury withdrawal for \"\"PFMS: Bringing Government Scale Adoption to Cardano by Trivolve Tech\"\". We believe the strategic scale, proven operational track record, and structured treasury return warrant our support.\n\nRationale\nReal-World Institutional Utility\nTransitioning state-level legal and forensic evidence tracking onto Cardano represents genuine enterprise adoption. By connecting thousands of facilities and managing millions of decentralized identity (DID) anchors, PFMS establishes Cardano as a foundational trust layer for high-stakes public sector systems.\n\nMeasurable Network Value & Sustainable Economics\nWith a projected volume of over 1.5 million annual mainnet transactions paid by state operational budgets and a revenue-sharing model returning 70% of verification fees to the Cardano Treasury, the proposal delivers clear economic value back to the network rather than functioning as an unrecouped grant.\n\nAccountable Milestone Governance\nOversight by the Cardano Foundation ensures transparent legal accountability, clear delivery milestones, and responsible fund disbursement, safeguarding delegator confidence and treasury capital.\n\nConclusion\nYoroi supports this initiative as an exemplary demonstration of real-world Cardano adoption and therefore votes YES."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}